    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/aac42ceb800fcf96c2881b1d25760e64.avif?t=1751210261\" width=348 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/429de2826d0d0e8f93f8523e7a375c0d.poster.avif?t=1751210261\" width=368 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/429de2826d0d0e8f93f8523e7a375c0d.webm?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/429de2826d0d0e8f93f8523e7a375c0d.mp4?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMON ASSISTANTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon all sort of weird whimsical <strong>creatures</strong>. From a clueless monkey to a cute pile of goo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/42ca9a99c440621571f83a7edcbc0913.poster.avif?t=1751210261\" width=368 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/42ca9a99c440621571f83a7edcbc0913.webm?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/42ca9a99c440621571f83a7edcbc0913.mp4?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COOK INGREDIENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make one weird soup by combining different <strong>magic ingredients</strong> together! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a unique mechanic of chain reactions, Cauldron Caution offers lots of depth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/68c72926ff053b1ed8ae247587fcccd4.poster.avif?t=1751210261\" width=368 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/68c72926ff053b1ed8ae247587fcccd4.webm?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/68c72926ff053b1ed8ae247587fcccd4.mp4?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR DECK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a <strong>custom deck</strong> of your<strong> favorite creatures and ingredients</strong> from your ever-growing <strong>collection</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/2e63cb694e4b6e909bebc66cc4d88d66.poster.avif?t=1751210261\" width=368 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/2e63cb694e4b6e909bebc66cc4d88d66.webm?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/2e63cb694e4b6e909bebc66cc4d88d66.mp4?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOLLOW A RICH NARRATIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shyla the Shyder is a <strong>strange pink insect lady</strong> that only seems to fall from one predator to the next. Until one day, she finds the opportunity to <strong>fight back</strong> by summoning other <strong>creatures</strong> to her side and cooking dubious <strong>magic recipes</strong> with her trusty <strong>cauldron</strong> !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cauldron Caution has a lot of charming NPCs to interact with, along with lots of bad jokes and crazy situations. A very energetic adventure awaits! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/d5e90986dc52e0d82c859074c317672c.poster.avif?t=1751210261\" width=368 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/d5e90986dc52e0d82c859074c317672c.webm?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/d5e90986dc52e0d82c859074c317672c.mp4?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONLINE PvP MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge</strong> your friends and strangers online to intense <strong>duels</strong>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/aac42ceb800fcf96c2881b1d25760e64.avif?t=1751210261\" width=348 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/429de2826d0d0e8f93f8523e7a375c0d.poster.avif?t=1751210261\" width=368 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/429de2826d0d0e8f93f8523e7a375c0d.webm?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/429de2826d0d0e8f93f8523e7a375c0d.mp4?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMON ASSISTANTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon all sort of weird whimsical <strong>creatures</strong>. From a clueless monkey to a cute pile of goo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/42ca9a99c440621571f83a7edcbc0913.poster.avif?t=1751210261\" width=368 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/42ca9a99c440621571f83a7edcbc0913.webm?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/42ca9a99c440621571f83a7edcbc0913.mp4?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COOK INGREDIENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make one weird soup by combining different <strong>magic ingredients</strong> together! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a unique mechanic of chain reactions, Cauldron Caution offers lots of depth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/68c72926ff053b1ed8ae247587fcccd4.poster.avif?t=1751210261\" width=368 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/68c72926ff053b1ed8ae247587fcccd4.webm?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/68c72926ff053b1ed8ae247587fcccd4.mp4?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR DECK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a <strong>custom deck</strong> of your<strong> favorite creatures and ingredients</strong> from your ever-growing <strong>collection</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/2e63cb694e4b6e909bebc66cc4d88d66.poster.avif?t=1751210261\" width=368 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/2e63cb694e4b6e909bebc66cc4d88d66.webm?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/2e63cb694e4b6e909bebc66cc4d88d66.mp4?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOLLOW A RICH NARRATIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shyla the Shyder is a <strong>strange pink insect lady</strong> that only seems to fall from one predator to the next. Until one day, she finds the opportunity to <strong>fight back</strong> by summoning other <strong>creatures</strong> to her side and cooking dubious <strong>magic recipes</strong> with her trusty <strong>cauldron</strong> !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cauldron Caution has a lot of charming NPCs to interact with, along with lots of bad jokes and crazy situations. A very energetic adventure awaits! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/d5e90986dc52e0d82c859074c317672c.poster.avif?t=1751210261\" width=368 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/d5e90986dc52e0d82c859074c317672c.webm?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991890/extras/d5e90986dc52e0d82c859074c317672c.mp4?t=1751210261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONLINE PvP MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge</strong> your friends and strangers online to intense <strong>duels</strong>!</p>",
    "short_description": "Cauldron Caution is a story-rich Card Battler. Fight against cartoony monsters with your Magic Creatures &amp; Ingredients. Find hidden Booster Packs by exploring this wild world to improve your collection. Meet quirky characters and solve diverse puzzles along the way.",
